# panel-knowledge-combined image context ignore list
#
# build.sh will rsync panel/ (team-memory-control) + knowledge/ (services/knowledge)
# to a temporary context directory, where this file takes effect.
# Purpose: to avoid including sensitive truth values / intranet information / large files in the image.

# ── Truth Configuration: Must be mounted at runtime, not included in the image ──
# metadata-instances.json contains tdai kernel Bearer token, see panel README deployment section.
panel/config/metadata-instances.json
panel/config/*.yaml
panel/config/*.yml
panel/.env
panel/.env.*
knowledge/.env
knowledge/.env.*

# ── Documentation: not required at runtime, and contains internal path references ──
# Exclude the two-layer docs/ entirely. The only spec required by runtime is knowledge/openapi.yaml (package root,
# src/server.ts reads it for Swagger UI), which is not under docs/, so it is unaffected.
panel/docs/
knowledge/docs/

# ── Test script: contains hardcoded internal environment paths, not required at runtime ──
panel/tests/
panel/e2e-*.sh
knowledge/__tests__/
knowledge/bin/e2e-*.sh

# ── Dependencies / Build Artifacts ──
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.git
**/logs
**/*.log
**/data/
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/*.sqlite

# ── Editor/OS Miscellaneous ──
**/.DS_Store
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/.iwiki
**/.codebuddy
